## 4️⃣ Double-check for other v2-only calls

| Mapbox v2 method | MapLibre status | What to do |
|------------------|----------------|------------|
| `map.setTerrain({source: 'mapbox-dem', exaggeration: 1.5})` | **Supported** (same name) – just ensure the source is not a `mapbox://` DEM. |
| `map.queryTerrainElevation(lngLat, {exaggerated: true})` | **Supported** – same call, but source must be a non-Mapbox DEM (e.g. `https://demotiles.maptiler.com/terrain/v2/`). |
| `map.setProjection({type: 'globe'})` | **Supported** – same call, but the `type` string is unchanged. |
| `map.setRTLTextPlugin(...)` | **Deprecated** – from MapLibre v6.9.0 Arabic/Hebrew rendering is built-in; you can simply delete the call. |
| `map.loadImage(url, cb)` | **Now returns a Promise** – replace callbacks with `await map.loadImage(url)` or `.then(...)`. |
| `GeoJSONSource.getCluster*` methods | **Now return Promises** – adjust `await`/`.then`. |

If you see any of those still using callbacks, convert them as shown above.

